040117: BillStClair

I put some wiki configuration advice at UseModSetup.

I'm not willing to call the new icon final yet. It's a nice idea, but the image itself is sort of monochrome and boring. I want to see Matt Apple's black and gold version, and maybe someone else will come up with something even more brilliant at AnCapWikiIconProject.

